  <item>
    <title>为什么说多数人活在未来</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f81baf623bc78c39dbec48</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f81baf623bc78c39dbec48</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 10 Apr 2025 19:37:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;活在当下这几个字是很容易读写出来的，拼在一起也不难理解其字面意思，可是有几个人能真的做到这简单的四个字呢？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="694">11:34</a>为什么说多数人一生都活在未来，特别是中国人？常见的现象是还没行动就立flag、吃着碗里却想着明天吃什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="695">11:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1361">22:41</a>探究为什么既活在过去，也活在未来，就是不看当下呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1362">22:42</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1822">30:22</a>活在当下，但！不等于放纵享乐！“永远不要担心2小时和8公里以外的事情”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1823">30:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2181">36:21</a>为什么要活在当下？好处是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2182">36:22</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2562">42:42</a>如何克服“活在未来”的思维僵局和“无法活在当下”的焦虑？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Music:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Rome-Dojo Cuts</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Go To Be Good-GottsStreet Park</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Don’t You DareStop-SAY SHE SHE</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Last Night-Dabeull&amp; Jordan Lee</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Shy-Leon Bridges</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Game Over-BobbyCaldwell</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6744d629b99a797d93158f9a/ljqwGpMLlIguTlnJXVFdozJ4hYEg.m4a" length="41437815" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:42:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fla5-2ep8GLHIjVSqaFbWy8G5HK2.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
