    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span>水星又逆行了，加上金星也在逆行，这两颗星体遇到土星和海王星大哥会带给我们什么影响呢？这是天文现象，但和我们息息相关，应对承接每一次的星体逆行考验就好！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a>水逆只是天文现象，但也别太不在意了，看看我的脑残经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="806">13:26</a>-26::26简述金星的逆行，以及水星金星在双鱼座的逆行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2019">33:39</a>群星的力量给双鱼座的磨砺，也是给每个星座的示范</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Music:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Everybody Wants to Rule the World—Tears forFears</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Dissolve—Absofacto</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Maddening Shroud—Frou Frou</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Pace of Light—上海復興方案</span></strong></p>]]></description>
