    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;</span><strong><span>&nbsp;我们是活生生的肉体，也具有着独特的灵魂，造物主给了我们很多很多，只是我们未曾开发自我，当有一天我们真的悟了，就是愉悦的回归时刻。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">07:46</a>由海奥华预言说起，造物主创造了一切之后的目的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a>灵魂等级的划分以及前世的记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1569">26:09</a>世界未解之谜是神灵的杰作吗？是否真的有神明？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2077">34:37</a>你的意识是无法想象的强大的！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>music</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Blu -- Ryuichi Sakamoto</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>羽の林で—Ryuichi Sakamoto</span></strong></p>]]></description>
