    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><strong><span>在投资领域很多人都掉进过坑里，有的爬出来学老实了，有的爬不出来还依旧深陷其中，让我们看看利用玄学的领域可以帮助到我们什么，前辈们踩过的大窟窿给了我们哪些启示？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="654">10:54</a>在投资上运用学术还是可以依赖玄学帮助？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1292">21:32</a>面对平凡的人生和只能饥饱的收入，都怪风水不好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1293">21:33</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1765">29:25</a>算命带来的到底是得益还是损失?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1766">29:26</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2308">38:28</a>天象和行星们只是在给我们提示，多学习多总结，趁势而为才是真的!</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Music</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>The Walker—Christine and the Queen</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Money Don't Matter 2 Night—Prince</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Making Plans for Nigel—XTC</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Kamacoma—Massive Attack</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>What Have I Done to Deserve this?—Pet Shop Boys</span></strong></p>]]></description>
