    <guid isPermaLink="false">67a39a99247d51713cd25fa7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 05 Feb 2025 19:11:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;万象更新，斗转星移，我们有幸见证这个全新时代的开启，星星们在积极地变换组合，给予我们高高低低的人生体验，就让我们跟随着繁星的脚步一起走进新次元！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">0:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">6:33</a>由立春这个新起点说说东西方在时辰和方位上的对应关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="394">6:34</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="863">14:23</a>送给所有水瓶座和冥王星进入水瓶时代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1231">20:31</a>详细聊一下九紫离火运的行业以及冥王星的特质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1232">20:32</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a>怎么样向宇宙下订单？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Music:</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Positivity—Suede</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Echoes—ODESZA</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Soiree—Ark Patrol</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>One Foot—WALKTHE MOON</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>MidnightCity—M83</span></strong></p>]]></description>
